<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-IRAN BEAT MALDIVES 9-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRAN BEAT MALDIVES 9-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran beat the Maldives 9-0</p>
<p>(halftime 7-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group two soccer</p>
<p>qualifier in Tehran on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Alireza Mansourian 15 45, Karim Baqeri 22 39, Ali</p>
<p>Daei 33 44, Mehdi Mahdavikia 35, Reza Shahroudi 68, Khodadad</p>
<p>Azizi 88.</p>
<p>    Standings     P   W   D   L   F   A   PTS</p>
<p> Iran		 5   5   0   0   37  1    15</p>
<p> Syria		4   2   0   2   25  3     6</p>
<p> Kyrgystan	  4   2   0   2   6  11     6</p>
<p> Maldives	   5   0   0   5   0  53     0</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 13 - Iran v Syria, Maldives v</p>
<p>Kyrgyzstan (both in Tehran)</p>
</text>
